<p nodeId="2db99e9560934c628f19822d78b1694e"><span font-size="13">条件组件：同IF...ELSE逻辑，当满足何种条件时执行某个输出动作。配置方式为交互式，可对以下参数进行判断，如有更多判断诉求可联系</span><km-mention name="刘思淼" uid="liusimiao" empId="" nodeId="60b8cb098eae48aca32548a3bfc88b73" /><span font-size="13">。配置方式参考</span><span font-size="13"><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/312585969#id-2.2%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E5%BC%8F%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99" title="规则交互式配置说明" nodeId="693cb83684654a7dbee4b36c6e431294"><span font-size="13">规则交互式配置说明</span></a></span></p>
